      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 389,
      "bookHadithIndex": 241,
      "text": "Madan [bin Talhah] said:\"I met Abu Ad-Darda, and I asked him what I had asked Thawban, so he said: 'Perform prostrations, for I heard Allah's Messenger saying: 'No worshipper performs a prostration to Allah except that by it Allah will raise him a level, and erase a sin from him for it",
