      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 395,
      "bookHadithIndex": 248,
      "text": "Abu Al-Muhallab narrated from Imran bin Husain that :the Prophet (S) led them in Salat he forgot (something) so he performed two prostrations, then the Tashah-hud, then the Salam",
